                    lev_wst_tang:           `Tangibility — concrete personal feedback: CA$ and meals saved this month`,
                    lev_wst_social:         `Social influence — most people waste less than you (norm)`,
                    lev_wst_aware:          `Awareness — remind people food waste is bad`,
                    r2_switch_label:        `SWITCH to plant-forward (one-off, identity): which SHIFT lever fits the barrier?`,
