                    r3_retention_label:     `Budget into 90-day habit mechanics (recurring prompts, defaults that persist) (CA$M)`,
                    r3_retention_hint:      `CA$M for the recurring prompts and defaults that make the behaviour stick past launch (drives retention). Drawn from the CA$4.0M above.`,

                    r4_pitch_label:         `The board killed the last two campaigns. What is the spine of your pitch?`,
                    pitch_conversion:       `Behaviour → matched levers → measured conversion and 90-day retention`,
                    pitch_reach:            `We will reach 5 million households — look at the scale of awareness`,
                    pitch_emotion:          `An inspiring planet story that will make people care`,
